# Relaunch after a feature

After you add or change a feature the user can see or use, rebuild and relaunch the app before you say the work is done. Do this without waiting to be asked.

```bash
make run
```

That builds Explorer, installs it to `/Applications/Explorer.app`, and opens that copy. Launchpad starts the copy in `/Applications`, so opening a second build starts a second app.

Skip this when the change cannot show up in the running app, such as a question, a review, or an edit that only touches tests or docs.
